// 快手发布页：同步视频。点击“上传视频”后，自动把发布管理里选中的视频文件写入文件输入框。
module.exports = {
  async run(ctx) {
    const step = ctx?.step || (() => {});
    const throwIfCancelled = ctx?.throwIfCancelled || (() => {});
    const waitSelector = ctx?.waitSelector;
    const trySetFileInputFilesEx = ctx?.trySetFileInputFilesEx;
    const clickSelectorPoint = ctx?.clickSelectorPoint;
    const delay = ctx?.delay || (async () => {});
    const evalJs0 = ctx?.evalJs0;
    const evalJsIn = ctx?.evalJsIn;
    const ctxId = Number(ctx?.ctxId || 0) || 0;
    const evalJs = (expression) => (typeof evalJsIn === "function" ? evalJsIn(expression, ctxId) : evalJs0?.(expression));
    const videoPath = String(ctx?.data?.videoPath || "").trim();
    const abs = videoPath ? ctx?.path?.resolve(videoPath) : "";
    if (!videoPath) return { ok: false, message: "empty videoPath" };
    if (!abs || !ctx?.fs?.existsSync?.(abs)) return { ok: false, message: `video not found: ${abs}` };

    const uploadBtnSel =
      "#joyride-wrapper > main > section > div._dragger-container_1j3uy_39 > div._dragger-content_1j3uy_39 > div._upload-text_1j3uy_68 > button";
    const fileSelList = [
      "#joyride-wrapper input[type='file'][accept*='video']",
      "#joyride-wrapper input[type='file']",
      "input[type='file'][accept*='video']",
      "input[type='file']"
    ];
    const probeUploadUi = async () => {
      return (await evalJs?.(
        `
(() => {
  const isVisible = (n) => {
    try {
      if (!n) return false;
      const r = n.getBoundingClientRect ? n.getBoundingClientRect() : null;
      if (!r) return true;
      return (r.width || 0) > 8 && (r.height || 0) > 8;
    } catch { return true; }
  };
  const textOf = (n) => String(n?.innerText || n?.textContent || "").replace(/\\s+/g, "");
  const fileInputs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll("input[type='file']"));
  const videoInputs = fileInputs.filter((n) => /video/i.test(String(n.getAttribute("accept") || "")));
  const btn =
    document.querySelector(${JSON.stringify(uploadBtnSel)}) ||
    Array.from(document.querySelectorAll("button,[role=button],div,span")).find((n) => isVisible(n) && textOf(n).includes("上传视频")) ||
    null;
  return {
    ok: true,
    hasUploadButton: !!btn,
    hasVideoInput: videoInputs.length > 0,
    hasAnyInput: fileInputs.length > 0,
    preferredSelector: videoInputs.length
      ? "input[type='file'][accept*='video']"
      : (fileInputs.length ? "input[type='file']" : "")
  };
})()
        `.trim()
      )) || null;
    };
    const buildSelectorQueue = (preferred) => {
      const list = [];
      const add = (sel) => {
        const s = String(sel || "").trim();
        if (!s || list.includes(s)) return;
        list.push(s);
      };
      add(preferred);
      fileSelList.forEach(add);
      return list;
    };

    throwIfCancelled();
    step("ks:video:probe_upload_ui");
    let uiState = await probeUploadUi();
    let clicked = false;

    if (!uiState?.hasVideoInput && !uiState?.hasAnyInput) {
      throwIfCancelled();
      step("ks:video:wait_upload_btn");
      await waitSelector?.(uploadBtnSel, 2500, ctxId).catch(() => false);

      throwIfCancelled();
      step("ks:video:click_upload_btn");
      if (typeof clickSelectorPoint === "function") clicked = !!(await clickSelectorPoint(uploadBtnSel, 40, 16));
      if (!clicked) {
        const probe = await evalJs?.(
          `
(() => {
  const textOf = (n) => String(n?.innerText || n?.textContent || "").replace(/\\s+/g, "");
  const isVisible = (n) => {
    try {
      if (!n) return false;
      const r = n.getBoundingClientRect ? n.getBoundingClientRect() : null;
      if (!r) return true;
      return (r.width || 0) > 12 && (r.height || 0) > 12;
    } catch { return true; }
  };
  const btn =
    document.querySelector(${JSON.stringify(uploadBtnSel)}) ||
    Array.from(document.querySelectorAll("button,[role=button],div,span")).find((n) => isVisible(n) && textOf(n).includes("上传视频")) ||
    null;
  if (!btn) return { ok: false, message: "no upload button" };
  try { btn.scrollIntoView({ block: "center", inline: "center" }); } catch {}
  try { btn.click(); } catch {}
  return { ok: true };
})()
          `.trim()
        );
        clicked = probe?.ok === true;
      }
      await delay(120);
      const probeStart = Date.now();
      while (Date.now() - probeStart < 2500) {
        throwIfCancelled();
        uiState = await probeUploadUi();
        if (uiState?.hasVideoInput || uiState?.hasAnyInput) break;
        await delay(120);
      }
    } else {
      step("ks:video:reuse_existing_input");
    }

    throwIfCancelled();
    step("ks:video:set_file");
    let setRes = null;
    const selectorQueue = buildSelectorQueue(uiState?.preferredSelector);
    for (const sel of selectorQueue) {
      throwIfCancelled();
      setRes = await trySetFileInputFilesEx?.(abs, "video", sel);
      if (setRes && setRes.ok === true) break;
    }
    if (!setRes || setRes.ok !== true) return { ok: false, message: String(setRes?.message || "set video file failed") };

    throwIfCancelled();
    step("ks:video:wait_form_ready");
    const start = Date.now();
    let ready = null;
    while (Date.now() - start < 240000) {
      throwIfCancelled();
      ready = await evalJs?.(
        `
(() => {
  const text = String(document.body?.innerText || document.body?.textContent || "");
  const hasEditor = !!document.querySelector("#work-description-edit");
  const hasCoverEntry = !!document.querySelector("#main-tours div._default-cover_ps02t_86 > div");
  const failed = /上传失败|上传出错/.test(text);
  const uploading = /上传中|处理中|转码中|校验中/.test(text);
  return { ok: !failed && (hasEditor || hasCoverEntry || uploading), hasEditor, hasCoverEntry, failed, uploading };
})()
        `.trim()
      );
      if (ready?.failed) return { ok: false, message: "video upload failed", result: ready };
      if (ready?.ok) break;
      const sec = Math.floor((Date.now() - start) / 5000);
      if (sec >= 1) step(`ks:video:waiting ${sec * 5}s`);
      await delay(300);
    }
    if (!ready?.ok) return { ok: false, message: "form not ready after upload", result: ready || null };
    step("ks:video:done");
    return { ok: true, abs, clickedUpload: clicked, ready };
  }
};
